  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Ramesh vs State Of Rajasthan Through Pp on 11 November, 2016 Author: Sabina Bench: Sabina In The High Court Of Judicature For Rajasthan Bench At Jaipur. Order S.B. Criminal Misc. Bail Application No.14337/2016 Ramesh, S/o Shri Surajmal, aged about 32 years, B/c Yadav, R/o Swamiyon Ki Dhani, Samod, Police Station Samod, District Jaipur (Rajasthan).",
    "facts": "Petitioner has filed this petition under Section 439 Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 seeking regular bail in F.I.R. No. 607/2016 registered at Police Station Chomu, District Jaipur, for offence under Sections 420, 269, 271, 273, 120-B Indian Penal Code, 1860 and Sections 63, 63A, 64 Copyright Act, 1957 and Section 7/16 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 1954. Present case relates to recovery of five tins of spurious Ghee from the petitioner and his co-accused. Petitioner is in custody since 19.10.2016. There is nothing on record to suggest that the petitioner is involved in any other criminal case.",
